# Cursor Rules — Production Hardening & Design Lock
# Repository: kawsar-design (Clone of https://kawsar.design/)

- Always run `node scripts/guard.mjs` before proposing or committing code changes.
- Ensure `public/assets/kawsar-exact-noise.png` is never deleted, recompressed or modified.
- Keep the exact verbatim copy: "Building digital products, brands, and experience.", "Designing interfaces that are intuitive, efficient, and enjoyable to use.", "whatsApp", "instagram".
- Ensure the footer contains exactly ONE semantic `<footer>` element with ONE copyright text node.
- Deploy live with `npm run ship` and verify on Cloudflare Pages (`https://kawsar.zenvq.com/`).
- Follow the Zero Oxford Comma policy in all prose, documentation and commit messages.
